{"id":4982,"date":"2025-08-06T11:57:38","date_gmt":"2025-08-06T11:57:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4982"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:24:45","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:24:45","slug":"flop-la-gi-nguyen-nhan-khien-video-bi-flop","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/flop-la-gi-nguyen-nhan-khien-video-bi-flop\/","title":{"rendered":"Flop l\u00e0 g\u00ec? Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n khi\u1ebfn video b\u1ecb flop tr\u00ean TikTok"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"JxZNdDEfeoZIP8xzCxclsURdg4b\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H1SsdvCYgoc3NUxcVtYl5yabgMf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u00ean TikTok, &#8220;flop&#8221; l\u00e0 khi video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, like hay comment nh\u01b0 k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng \u2014 d\u00f9 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u1ed9i dung k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng. Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn sai th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng, d\u00f9ng hashtag kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, n\u1ed9i dung thi\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i. Video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 ch\u1ec9n chu nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn flop, kh\u00f4ng ai xem hay t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c? B\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb flop tr\u00ean TikTok kh\u00f4ng? H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng <strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong> xem ngay nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoOPdjjsHoQk2Uxw4FClPgDIgAf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZalNdnhbGogEtmx4J87l58Q3gjd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. Flop l\u00e0 g\u00ec tr\u00ean TikTok?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QfU9dRhlhozSjUxFTOJl4myyg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Flop tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 thu\u1eadt ng\u1eef d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eefng video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c lan truy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng. M\u1ed9t video b\u1ecb xem l\u00e0 &#8220;flop&#8221; khi n\u00f3 c\u00f3 \u00edt l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, like, comment, ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok \u0111\u1ea9y l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, d\u00f9 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u1ed9i dung ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HkCvdX2cBoJM9RxNff7l7NvXgKc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>V\u00ed d\u1ee5:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuAddmwd1oMGy3xCuEhlivFlgEg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 100.000 view\/video, nh\u01b0ng video m\u1edbi ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ea1t v\u00e0i tr\u0103m \u2192 g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 flop.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9vad4kfGorh1OxQcGAl7LXrg7f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Flop kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ngh\u0129a video k\u00e9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 do hashtag sai, n\u1ed9i dung kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p trend, ho\u1eb7c thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n kh\u00f4ng \u01b0u ti\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AlKYdGFVxoCd0NxAjEnl11GMgvd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5020\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5020\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5020\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Flop-la-gi.png\" alt=\"Flop tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 thu\u1eadt ng\u1eef d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eefng video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c lan truy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Flop-la-gi.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Flop-la-gi-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Flop-la-gi-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Flop-la-gi-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Flop-la-gi-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5020\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Flop tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 thu\u1eadt ng\u1eef d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 nh\u1eefng video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c lan truy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JxZNdDEfeoZIP8xzCxclsURdg4b\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WRYodXNatoydA8x4neOltXA9gYb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n khi\u1ebfn video b\u1ecb flop tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F3RidACJioFnFnxx9gTlc2pYgkc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Video TikTok b\u1ecb \u201cflop\u201d th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 do m\u1ed9t y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n, t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1c l\u00fd do ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn khi\u1ebfn video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i r\u1ed9ng r\u00e3i ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c mong \u0111\u1ee3i:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CZ0MdTQSeoTauRxiKjZlIcWQgt6\" style=\"text-align: left;\">1. <strong>N\u1ed9i dung k\u00e9m h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebfu s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LLAGdcuVFov39CxHxOYl7v8wg42\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng \u201cl\u01b0\u1edbt nhanh\u201d, n\u00ean n\u1ebfu video kh\u00f4ng g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong 1\u20133 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, h\u1ecd s\u1ebd b\u1ecf qua. N\u1ed9i dung qu\u00e1 \u0111\u01a1n \u0111i\u1ec7u, thi\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ho\u1eb7c l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i trend c\u0169 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 m\u1edbi l\u1ea1 th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng lan truy\u1ec1n. TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean video gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem l\u00e2u, c\u00f3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c th\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5023\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5023\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5023\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Noi-dung-kem-hap-dan-hoac-thieu-sang-tao.png\" alt=\"g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong 1\u20133 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Noi-dung-kem-hap-dan-hoac-thieu-sang-tao.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Noi-dung-kem-hap-dan-hoac-thieu-sang-tao-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Noi-dung-kem-hap-dan-hoac-thieu-sang-tao-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Noi-dung-kem-hap-dan-hoac-thieu-sang-tao-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Noi-dung-kem-hap-dan-hoac-thieu-sang-tao-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5023\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">G\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong 1\u20133 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XLEMd8mZroNKM8xAqm1lAPosgRg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 2. Vi ph\u1ea1m ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKJed8HVuoeF9xxgBqElTUAygDf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok c\u00f3 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t. N\u1ebfu video ch\u1ee9a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ph\u1ea3n c\u1ea3m, ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, th\u00f4ng tin g\u00e2y hi\u1ec3u nh\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c k\u00edch \u0111\u1ed9ng, n\u00f3 s\u1ebd b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i\u00a0 d\u00f9 ch\u01b0a b\u1ecb x\u00f3a. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p b\u1ecb \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 vi ph\u1ea1m ngay c\u1ea3 khi n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ec9 \u201cnh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m\u201d theo thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n AI.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5028\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5028\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5028\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Vi-pham-tieu-chuan-cong-dong.png\" alt=\"H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Vi-pham-tieu-chuan-cong-dong.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Vi-pham-tieu-chuan-cong-dong-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Vi-pham-tieu-chuan-cong-dong-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Vi-pham-tieu-chuan-cong-dong-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Vi-pham-tieu-chuan-cong-dong-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5028\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ki\u1ec3m duy\u1ec7t nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W5DFdvW7MoXb33xGnv5lBJuDgQf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 3. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u00e2m thanh\/h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KCmFd7TREoqhPMxGhXFlhjIGggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u00f9ng nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u1ea5p ph\u00e9p, c\u1eaft gh\u00e9p n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 logo c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u00e1c, ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng video c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cho ph\u00e9p \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn video kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb r\u1ed9ng r\u00e3i. Nhi\u1ec1u tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p video v\u1eabn c\u00f2n tr\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem m\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HNvwdXz7joIONFxkRBHlWYy2g9f\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 4. T\u0103ng t\u1ea3i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ho\u1eb7c d\u1eabn link b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SPRadE3Pcoz1kvxqgRPld5aEgle\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t ch\u1eb7t n\u1ed9i dung th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u00e8n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u CTA mua h\u00e0ng, spam link, hay l\u1ea1m d\u1ee5ng d\u1eabn v\u1ec1 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c (Shopee, Instagram, website\u2026), video d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 l\u00e0 \u201cqu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00e1 h\u00ecnh\u201d v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. Ngay c\u1ea3 video TikTok Shop c\u0169ng c\u1ea7n n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 \u201cb\u00e1n h\u00e0ng\u201d m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u00f4.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5027\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5027\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5027\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-tai-quang-cao-hoac-dan-link-ben-ngoai.png\" alt=\"TikTok Shop c\u0169ng c\u1ea7n n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-tai-quang-cao-hoac-dan-link-ben-ngoai.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-tai-quang-cao-hoac-dan-link-ben-ngoai-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-tai-quang-cao-hoac-dan-link-ben-ngoai-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-tai-quang-cao-hoac-dan-link-ben-ngoai-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-tai-quang-cao-hoac-dan-link-ben-ngoai-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5027\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Shop c\u0169ng c\u1ea7n n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MPspdv1d3o2Xpexc4AQl5VrIgfg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 5. Reup n\u1ed9i dung t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i video<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UrKLdnC50oYFe1x0bFgl7pZngvd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean n\u1ed9i dung <strong>nguy\u00ean b\u1ea3n<\/strong>. Khi b\u1ea1n t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i video t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c, ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng l\u1ea1i ch\u00ednh video c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n (d\u00f9 \u0111\u00e3 c\u1eaft gh\u00e9p l\u1ea1i), thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y khi\u1ebfn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 nguy c\u01a1 b\u1ecb gi\u1ea3m \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn d\u1ea7n theo th\u1eddi gian.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SFZodvQb5oxdJ0xo0FGlleZIgMn\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 6. Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n (hashtag, caption, gi\u1edd \u0111\u0103ng)<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XaJodM547on8QJxMiHQlrsmWg9J\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i c\u1ee9 d\u00f9ng hashtag l\u00e0 video s\u1ebd viral. N\u1ebfu hashtag kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang n\u1ed9i dung, caption m\u01a1 h\u1ed3 ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebfu l\u1eddi k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng, video d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb \u201ctr\u00f4i\u201d. Th\u00eam v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng sai khung gi\u1edd (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: v\u00e0o l\u00fac \u00edt ng\u01b0\u1eddi online) c\u0169ng khi\u1ebfn video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea9y l\u00ean \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem ban \u0111\u1ea7u, l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YlWQde7FOoSbwSxmd35lHgKygOg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>7. Shadowban ho\u1eb7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DWCDd5c2No6qANx7T39lYrQvgnB\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n t\u1eebng vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch, b\u1ecb ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o, ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 h\u00e0nh vi b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng (spam, follow\/unfollow li\u00ean t\u1ee5c, \u0111\u0103ng nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00f9ng l\u1eb7p&#8230;), TikTok c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u201c\u00e2m th\u1ea7m\u201d h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u1ea7m nh\u00ecn c\u1ee7a video. \u0110\u00e2y g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 shadowban \u2013 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c, nh\u01b0ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ed9t ng\u1ed9t s\u1ee5t gi\u1ea3m, ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu ch\u1ec9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i c\u0169.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cy4HdRrSSouDr5xDaIKlJ0apgkf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5025\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5025\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5025\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Shadowban-hoac-tai-khoan-bi-han-che.png\" alt=\"H\u00e0nh vi b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng (spam, follow\/unfollow li\u00ean t\u1ee5c, \u0111\u0103ng nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00f9ng l\u1eb7p...)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Shadowban-hoac-tai-khoan-bi-han-che.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Shadowban-hoac-tai-khoan-bi-han-che-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Shadowban-hoac-tai-khoan-bi-han-che-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Shadowban-hoac-tai-khoan-bi-han-che-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Shadowban-hoac-tai-khoan-bi-han-che-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5025\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">H\u00e0nh vi b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng (spam, follow\/unfollow li\u00ean t\u1ee5c, \u0111\u0103ng nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00f9ng l\u1eb7p&#8230;)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JxZNdDEfeoZIP8xzCxclsURdg4b\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FiNVdP6LXoZhdRxZgYLlBcrjgUh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1ch kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c video b\u1ecb flop tr\u00ean TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ang7doVMQoWa1IxLHKdlUTMRgph\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u1ebfu video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u0103ng l\u00ean nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c nh\u01b0 k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng, \u0111\u1eebng v\u1ed9i n\u1ea3n. TikTok l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ec1 cao t\u00ednh th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 th\u00edch nghi nhanh. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u1ea3ng t\u1ed5ng nh\u1eefng c\u00e1ch m\u00e0 Lemon Digital cho l\u00e0 s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c v\u00e0 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng flop trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai:<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UdRndfXqAo5wIixwhwTlu0pjgcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"fallback\"><span class=\"block-paste-placeholder\">N\u1ed9i dung n\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 trong Lark Docs<\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BzkGdArPUoeF5qx9tp8lU3aFglb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c video b\u1ecb flop tr\u00ean TikTok kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb n\u1ed9i dung m\u00e0 c\u00f2n li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n, th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng, \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng v\u00e0 c\u1ea3 c\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem. \u0110\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n, hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u00e1ch ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm ra c\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nh\u1ea5t v\u1edbi k\u00eanh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n ki\u00ean tr\u00ec \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a video tho\u00e1t flop v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem mong mu\u1ed1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Tr\u00ean TikTok, &#8220;flop&#8221; l\u00e0 khi video kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, like hay comment nh\u01b0 k\u1ef3 v\u1ecdng \u2014 d\u00f9 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u1ed9i dung k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng. Nguy\u00ean nh\u00e2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn sai th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng, d\u00f9ng hashtag kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, n\u1ed9i dung thi\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5046,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4982","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4982","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4982"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4982\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5216,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4982\/revisions\/5216"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5046"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4982"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4982"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4982"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}